{"description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "On Writing is both a textbook for writers and a memoir of Stephen's life and will, thus, appeal even to those who are not aspiring writers. If you've always wondered what led Steve to become a writer and how he came to be the success he is today, this will answer those questions.\r\n\r\n([source][1])\r\n\r\n\r\n  [1]: https://stephenking.com/library/nonfiction/on_writing_a_memoir_of_the_craft.html"}, "links": [{"title": "StephenKing.com - On Writing: A Memoir of the Craft", "url": "https://stephenking.com/library/nonfiction/on_writing_a_memoir_of_the_craft.html", "type": {"key": "/type/link"}}, {"title": "On Writing: A Memoir of the Craft - Wikipedia", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/On_Writing:_A_Memoir_of_the_Craft", "type": {"key": "/type/link"}}, {"title": "King's English - Review | The Guardian", "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/books/2000/oct/07/biography.stephenking", "type": {"key": "/type/link"}}], "title": "On Writing", "covers": [9255939, 9778833, 10245685, 10466378, 10893157, 10702001, 11942411, 11123654, -1, 14193417, 14193416, 14193418, 14193419, 12275911, 12302121], "subject_places": ["Lisbon Falls", "Maine"], "subjects": ["writing", "Salem\u2019s Lot", "science fiction", "Happy Stamps", "The Elements of Style", "drinking", "adverbs", "Horror tales--Authorship", "Locus Award winner", "Bram Stoker Award winner", "biography", "Arte de escribir", "Novelistas estadounidenses", "Biograf\u00eda", "Autores estadounidenses", "American Novelists", "Technique", "Literary Memoir", "American Authors", "Authorship", "Memoir", "authors", "Horror tales", "Cuentos de terror", "Reading Level-Grade 11", "Reading Level-Grade 12", "Authors, biography", "Horror tales, authorship", "King, stephen, 1947-", "Performing arts, biography", "nyt:education=2014-12-07", "New York Times bestseller", "Personal memoirs", "[document]", "Style", "\u00c9crivains am\u00e9ricains", "Biographies", "R\u00e9cits d'horreur", "Art d'\u0